{
  "title": "Felinors vs Humans, the release: the set ships",
  "sources": "Issues #5222 (wave 1), F #5235, E1–E4 #5236–#5239, S01–S12 #5251–#5262, P1 #5263, P2 #5264, tracker #5220",
  "notes": "The Felinors vs Humans set ships (R1420, R5222000), gated for the AI's own decks until wave 2 (R1390); Core #79 Twinspell's base face prints Durability 1 (R5236006); a Nerf may add Fragile to a Unit and Unlucky to a card with a luck roll (R5236011, R5236021); the Call to Chaos editions' refs and pools take FvH #100; the set's look (R5264000) and its 63 card intros (R5222001)",
  "player": {
    "title": "Felinors vs Humans, a new set",
    "new": [
      "Felinors vs Humans joins the game: 197 cards and 35 tokens, Felinors against Humans, 82 Plagiarized reprints of Infinite Assault cards among them.",
      "New keywords come with it: Durability, Fragile and Unlucky, and new tags: Plagiarized, Roblox-Tool and Golem.",
      "Every Legendary and Mythic of the set opens its play with a few bars of its own."
    ],
    "balance": [],
    "changes": [
      "Twinspell prints Durability 1 in place of sending itself to the graveyard: one use still sends it there, and a Buff can give it a second.",
      "A Nerf may now give a Unit Fragile, and give Unlucky 1 to a card that rolls its luck or raise the Unlucky it has.",
      "Random cards, Discover and Call to Chaos draw from the new set too, and Call to Chaos has an eighth edition."
    ],
    "text": [],
    "fixes": []
  },
